    "text": "<p>Molarity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>46</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;molecular mass of solute</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;density of the solution in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;solute by mass.</p>"
